WEBVTT

01:33.340 --> 01:35.611
(Adapted from the web novel "Waiting for You in a City")

01:35.671 --> 01:37.971
(Fireworks of My Heart)

01:38.040 --> 01:40.941
(Episode 23)

01:51.760 --> 01:52.721
Good work.

02:31.091 --> 02:31.901
Dr. Xu.

02:33.001 --> 02:34.931
Do you still remember the vow you made...

02:35.001 --> 02:36.431
when you initially chose...

02:36.501 --> 02:37.800
to study medicine?

02:39.241 --> 02:40.871
"I will consciously uphold..."

02:40.941 --> 02:43.140
"the dignity, sanctity, and noble traditions of medicine."

02:44.441 --> 02:46.311
"I will give human life..."

02:46.510 --> 02:47.681
"the greatest respect,"

02:48.711 --> 02:49.881
"equality, and benevolence."

02:50.450 --> 02:51.651
"Prioritize patients."

02:51.881 --> 02:53.281
"Respect life."

02:54.281 --> 02:55.651
"Learn for a lifetime."

02:56.221 --> 02:58.491
"Strive to take on the noble duty..."

02:58.790 --> 03:00.061
"of improving human health."

03:13.341 --> 03:15.540
A doctor is a human.

03:16.211 --> 03:18.010
Your biggest problem...

03:18.480 --> 03:19.781
is that you lack...

03:20.080 --> 03:22.181
basic belief in your profession.

03:22.311 --> 03:25.251
You've ignored the oath of a doctor.

03:26.550 --> 03:27.350
That's why...

03:27.420 --> 03:31.221
you can't feel the honor and tradition of medicine.

03:35.330 --> 03:36.091
Thank you,

03:36.591 --> 03:37.461
Dr. Xu.

03:41.531 --> 03:43.170
I don't deserve to be thanked.

04:33.351 --> 04:34.320
Stop wiping.

04:37.320 --> 04:38.460
It's clean now.

04:40.660 --> 04:41.460
Let's go.

04:42.090 --> 04:42.991
We're still needed.

05:05.650 --> 05:06.320
Fall in.

05:06.921 --> 05:07.580
Fall in.

05:08.621 --> 05:09.351
- Yes. - Fall in.

05:21.530 --> 05:22.371
Put on your helmets.

05:24.301 --> 05:25.001
Pack up your gears.

05:25.741 --> 05:26.801
Get ready to go to the next location.

05:27.171 --> 05:28.340
- Yes. - Yes.

05:30.140 --> 05:30.871
Don't forget anything.

05:34.510 --> 05:35.681
- Chief. - Chief.

05:35.751 --> 05:36.410
Are you okay?

05:36.481 --> 05:37.611
Get a bottle of water.

05:56.801 --> 05:57.501
Are you okay?

05:59.871 --> 06:00.640
I'm fine.

06:03.871 --> 06:04.570
Drink more water.

06:06.441 --> 06:07.111
Come on.

06:22.660 --> 06:23.390
- Let's go. - Yes.

06:23.760 --> 06:24.590
Wait.

06:29.001 --> 06:30.101
Remember to eat...

06:30.400 --> 06:31.101
and drink water.

06:31.640 --> 06:32.801
Every few hours,

06:32.871 --> 06:34.541
close your eyes and rest for more than 10 minutes.

06:35.171 --> 06:36.741
If it gets serious, you'll die.

06:37.871 --> 06:38.580
Thank you.

06:43.780 --> 06:44.611
It's the same for all of you.

06:44.681 --> 06:45.520
Do you hear me?

06:46.051 --> 06:47.450
- Thank you, Dr. Xu. - Thank you, Dr. Xu.

06:49.220 --> 06:50.020
I'll get going.

06:56.160 --> 06:56.960
Don't forget anything.

06:57.030 --> 06:57.791
- Let's go. - Okay.

07:08.611 --> 07:09.541
Be careful!

07:23.121 --> 07:24.991
Heroes never exist in our imaginations.

07:25.590 --> 07:27.291
They're all around us.

07:28.291 --> 07:28.960
Song Yan.

07:29.691 --> 07:31.390
I think I understand what you said.

07:32.131 --> 07:33.330
Money can't buy...

07:33.400 --> 07:34.330
your willingness.

07:34.801 --> 07:36.001
I'm willing to be an angel.

07:36.801 --> 07:38.030
I'm willing to contribute selflessly...

07:38.470 --> 07:39.770
with no ulterior motives.

07:41.541 --> 07:43.140
(Wangxiang, Yancheng 6.5 earthquake disaster rescue in full swing)

07:43.210 --> 07:44.241
Viewers.

07:44.570 --> 07:46.510
The rescued baby we reported on earlier...

07:46.580 --> 07:48.450
is a miracle of life.

07:48.681 --> 07:49.650
The one who saved this baby...

07:49.710 --> 07:51.580
is our municipal hospital's Emergency Department doctor,

07:51.650 --> 07:52.450
Xu Qin.

07:52.681 --> 07:54.681
Since Dr. Xu is still fighting hard...

07:54.751 --> 07:55.820
- She's reporting on Qin Qin. - on the front line...

07:55.890 --> 07:56.720
of the disaster rescue,

07:56.890 --> 07:58.191
we didn't get to interview her.

07:58.291 --> 08:00.561
We'll keep you updated on the latest situation.

08:01.390 --> 08:02.731
Why did you turn it off?

08:03.390 --> 08:04.191
Let's eat.

08:12.941 --> 08:14.241
If they work continuously like this,

08:14.601 --> 08:15.910
there will be a problem.

08:16.910 --> 08:18.041
It's not that serious.

08:18.881 --> 08:19.640
Don't worry.

08:20.241 --> 08:21.881
They'll take care of themselves.

08:22.681 --> 08:23.481
Huai Jin.

08:23.950 --> 08:26.381
Regarding the donation of Guokun,

08:26.621 --> 08:28.820
you should let the media report on it.

08:29.520 --> 08:31.020
Also, Yan Chen,

08:31.090 --> 08:32.791
you've donated a lot of things too.

08:33.191 --> 08:35.020
You should promote it as well.

08:36.361 --> 08:37.361
I don't plan to.

08:37.631 --> 08:38.631
Why?

08:39.601 --> 08:40.701
In doing a good deed,

08:40.861 --> 08:41.900
you must leave a name...

08:42.371 --> 08:43.670
and fight for a reward.

08:44.300 --> 08:45.071
Huai Jin.

08:45.440 --> 08:46.270
As they say,

08:47.001 --> 08:48.201
"From now on..."

08:49.040 --> 08:50.940
"People from Lu won't redeem slaves from other nations anymore."

08:51.841 --> 08:52.611
Yan Chen.

08:53.010 --> 08:54.510
What your mom said makes sense.

08:56.280 --> 08:56.951
Let's eat.

09:05.420 --> 09:06.160
Calling headquarters.

09:06.221 --> 09:07.390
Calling headquarters. This is Li Bin.

09:07.461 --> 09:08.390
Requesting backup.

09:09.030 --> 09:09.690
Headquarters, copy.

09:09.760 --> 09:10.430
Headquarters, copy.

09:10.491 --> 09:11.560
Please report your location.

09:11.631 --> 09:12.300
Xiao Li.

09:12.560 --> 09:13.300
Here, check again.

09:13.361 --> 09:17.601
(Wangxiang, Yancheng 6.5 earthquake disaster rescue headquarters)

09:17.670 --> 09:18.331
Hello.

09:18.900 --> 09:19.701
Please help me find these two people...

09:19.770 --> 09:21.471
on the list of casualties and missing people list.

09:21.670 --> 09:22.341
Okay.

09:25.310 --> 09:27.810
(Search)

09:27.881 --> 09:28.680
(Not found)

09:32.221 --> 09:33.851
(Search)

09:34.520 --> 09:35.721
I don't see those two.

09:37.491 --> 09:38.290
Thank you.

09:38.351 --> 09:39.020
You're welcome.

09:46.831 --> 09:48.631
Are these also the casualties and missing people list?

09:48.900 --> 09:50.300
Yes. They were just reported.

09:50.371 --> 09:51.231
It hasn't been organized and registered yet.

09:57.670 --> 09:58.611
Don't be too anxious too.

09:59.010 --> 10:00.780
A few medical sites still haven't sent their reports.

10:01.140 --> 10:02.251
We'll keep an eye out for them.

10:02.481 --> 10:03.680
Do you have the address and contact information?

10:03.981 --> 10:04.910
You want to search there?

10:05.621 --> 10:06.981
It's not easy to get there now.

10:07.550 --> 10:08.321
Please write it down for me.

10:09.050 --> 10:09.721
Okay.

10:23.501 --> 10:24.201
Are these two...

10:24.270 --> 10:25.201
your relatives?

10:27.601 --> 10:28.270
They're family.

10:34.680 --> 10:35.780
- Thank you. - You're welcome.

10:39.920 --> 10:43.321
(Armed Police Rescue)

10:47.961 --> 10:48.961
Lift and put down gently.

10:49.160 --> 10:49.930
Watch your speed.

10:50.530 --> 10:52.501
Record every item clearly.

10:55.900 --> 10:56.571
Comrade.

10:56.631 --> 10:57.300
Thank you for your hard work.

10:57.371 --> 10:58.101
You came just in time.

10:58.170 --> 10:59.241
These are what we need urgently.

10:59.670 --> 11:00.670
The timeline is too tight.

11:00.741 --> 11:02.440
More supplies can only be delivered tomorrow.

11:02.510 --> 11:03.410
Hello, Comrade.

11:04.140 --> 11:05.711
Are there disposable suture kits and thoracentesis sets...

11:05.780 --> 11:06.581
in this vehicle?

11:06.640 --> 11:07.341
I'm sorry, Comrade.

11:07.410 --> 11:08.140
We don't have them on this one.

11:09.451 --> 11:10.550
- Thank you. - Get some rest.

11:10.611 --> 11:11.280
I'll go there first.

11:11.351 --> 11:12.081
Okay, I'll leave you to it.

11:12.150 --> 11:13.050
Hello, Comrade.

11:13.121 --> 11:14.420
Among the new medical supplies,

11:14.680 --> 11:16.520
are there disposable suture kits and thoracentesis sets?

11:16.591 --> 11:18.190
I'm sorry, we don't have those yet.

11:19.890 --> 11:20.560
Thank you.

11:22.131 --> 11:22.790
Comrade.

11:25.760 --> 11:26.430
Hello, Comrade.

11:26.831 --> 11:28.770
- Hello. - Have we met before?

11:32.471 --> 11:33.201
I'm sorry.

11:33.270 --> 11:34.270
I don't really remember.

11:34.501 --> 11:35.810
It's normal that you don't remember.

11:35.871 --> 11:37.341
It must have been a long time ago.

11:39.310 --> 11:40.040
I'm Lu Jie...

11:40.140 --> 11:40.881
from the Mobile Forces.

11:41.841 --> 11:42.780
These are all my soldiers.

11:45.851 --> 11:46.721
Dr. Xu.

11:47.020 --> 11:48.890
There's a fractured victim from Surgery here. Hurry.

11:49.420 --> 11:50.091
Got it.

11:50.150 --> 11:50.821
I'm sorry.

11:52.890 --> 11:53.560
Battalion Commander.

11:53.621 --> 11:54.660
What are you doing?

11:55.060 --> 11:56.160
This is inappropriate.

11:56.961 --> 11:57.961
What do you mean?

11:58.030 --> 11:59.001
What are you thinking about?

11:59.260 --> 12:01.900
I was a scout back then.

12:02.170 --> 12:02.971
I won't forget...

12:03.071 --> 12:04.231
someone I've seen before.

12:04.831 --> 12:07.300
I've definitely seen that female doctor before.

12:10.010 --> 12:10.810
What are you doing?

12:10.910 --> 12:11.841
Get back to work.

12:11.910 --> 12:12.581
All right.

12:15.040 --> 12:16.481
- Can you move your fingers? - What's the situation?

12:16.550 --> 12:17.211
Dr. Xu.

12:17.510 --> 12:18.410
He has a fracture on his left arm.

12:18.481 --> 12:19.621
We dressed it simply.

12:19.780 --> 12:20.451
There's nothing else.

12:20.520 --> 12:21.351
He's conscious.

12:21.991 --> 12:23.020
Let my team take care of him.

12:23.290 --> 12:23.951
Okay.

12:24.020 --> 12:24.890
Please take him inside.

12:24.951 --> 12:25.621
This way, please.

12:26.260 --> 12:27.020
By the way, Dr. Xu.

12:27.221 --> 12:28.121
I came with the chief.

12:28.190 --> 12:28.861
He's not feeling well.

12:28.930 --> 12:29.961
I told him to come, but he wouldn't listen.

12:30.030 --> 12:30.690
He's in the parking lot over there.

12:30.760 --> 12:31.461
Why don't you check on him?

12:33.461 --> 12:34.231
Dr. He.

12:34.601 --> 12:35.331
You guys examine him first.

12:35.400 --> 12:36.201
I'll be right back.

12:36.270 --> 12:36.930
Okay.

12:53.520 --> 12:54.221
Song...

14:36.790 --> 14:37.491
Chief.

14:38.020 --> 14:38.790
Wake up. Here.

14:39.020 --> 14:39.861
This is from Dr. Xu.

14:39.920 --> 14:41.020
It's really good. It's very sweet.

14:42.591 --> 14:43.461
Did you see her?

14:43.660 --> 14:44.331
Yes.

14:45.530 --> 14:46.660
Didn't she come to see you just now?

15:08.680 --> 15:09.351
Let's go.

15:09.821 --> 15:10.491
Let's go.

15:47.260 --> 15:47.991
What is Jiang Yi doing?

15:48.821 --> 15:49.591
Counting.

15:50.361 --> 15:51.331
Counting what?

15:53.400 --> 15:54.660
The number of rescued people.

15:57.770 --> 15:59.241
For every person we save,

15:59.640 --> 16:00.701
he draws a line.

16:12.481 --> 16:13.221
Jiang Yi.

16:15.690 --> 16:16.491
Come here.

16:44.280 --> 16:45.550
You need to be mentally prepared.

16:49.321 --> 16:50.650
- At the headquarters... - I don't want to hear it now.

16:50.721 --> 16:52.390
- Where are you going? - I don't want to hear it now.

16:54.991 --> 16:55.991
One more person.

16:57.831 --> 16:59.030
Then I'll have saved 20 people.

16:59.430 --> 17:00.731
Jiang Yi.

17:06.841 --> 17:08.501
According to the headquarters,

17:09.310 --> 17:10.071
during the earthquake,

17:11.071 --> 17:12.511
your mom was with your aunt...

17:12.910 --> 17:14.041
getting an IV drip at the clinic.

17:14.841 --> 17:16.381
The collapse is very serious.

17:18.111 --> 17:19.551
No survivors have been found yet.

17:23.351 --> 17:24.920
Why are you telling me this?

17:26.321 --> 17:28.521
Why are you telling me this?

17:29.730 --> 17:31.230
I don't want to hear it now.

17:33.960 --> 17:35.601
My mom will surely be fine.

17:36.970 --> 17:37.970
She will be fine.

17:53.950 --> 17:54.621
Jiang Yi.

17:54.680 --> 17:55.351
Ms. Li.

17:57.121 --> 17:58.321
What should I do now?

18:01.761 --> 18:03.261
I'm an orphan now.

18:04.460 --> 18:06.531
I don't have a mom anymore.

18:09.601 --> 18:10.900
I don't have a mom anymore.

18:21.680 --> 18:22.381
Jiang Yi.

18:30.690 --> 18:31.750
I don't have a mom.

18:36.831 --> 18:38.031
Mom.

18:39.131 --> 18:40.031
Jiang Yi.

18:57.351 --> 18:58.150
Ms. Li.

18:58.650 --> 18:59.581
How's Jiang Yi?

19:03.950 --> 19:04.920
Chief Song called.

19:05.150 --> 19:06.660
He wants us to go to the nursing home for search and rescue.

19:06.720 --> 19:08.121
He and Yang Chi are already on their way.

19:10.660 --> 19:11.430
You guys go ahead.

19:12.430 --> 19:13.160
There's no need to call Jiang Yi.

19:16.700 --> 19:17.631
Pack your gears.

19:17.771 --> 19:18.430
Get ready to go.

19:18.500 --> 19:19.640
- Okay. - Yes.

19:19.700 --> 19:20.470
Stop crying.

19:25.881 --> 19:26.541
Pour it.

19:28.381 --> 19:29.081
Pour it.

19:32.081 --> 19:32.851
Okay.

19:34.351 --> 19:35.220
Are you ready?

19:35.650 --> 19:36.321
- Yes. - Yes.

19:36.390 --> 19:37.351
Get in the car. Let's go.

19:37.490 --> 19:38.150
- Yes. - Yes.

20:03.450 --> 20:04.950
Jiang Yi, are you okay?

20:05.450 --> 20:06.621
Are you all right, Jiang Yi?

20:07.621 --> 20:08.281
Hop on the vehicle.

20:09.121 --> 20:09.821
Let's go.

20:11.890 --> 20:12.621
Get in.

20:21.801 --> 20:25.601
(Yanbei, Yancheng Fire and Rescue, Shilitai)

20:45.190 --> 20:46.061
Dong Dong, when you're done,

20:46.121 --> 20:47.791
- let me use the tape. - Okay.

20:48.920 --> 20:49.660
Here, Ms. Nan.

20:49.730 --> 20:50.390
Okay.

20:52.601 --> 20:55.160
I wonder what happened to the firefighters at Shilitai.

20:55.871 --> 20:56.700
Don't worry.

20:56.771 --> 20:57.801
They'll be fine.

20:58.101 --> 20:59.301
Rescuing people from ruins...

20:59.371 --> 21:00.700
is the specialty of firefighters.

21:01.341 --> 21:02.940
But they also have the toughest jobs.

21:03.541 --> 21:04.940
I heard from General Surgery today...

21:05.011 --> 21:06.011
that a firefighter...

21:06.081 --> 21:07.440
got retinal perforation from exhaustion.

21:08.081 --> 21:08.881
Which fire station is he from?

21:08.940 --> 21:09.950
What's his name?

21:10.180 --> 21:10.980
I've asked them.

21:11.051 --> 21:12.450
He came to assist from somewhere else.

21:12.521 --> 21:13.480
They're not from our city.

21:13.750 --> 21:14.581
You scared me.

21:17.390 --> 21:18.051
Go!

21:18.551 --> 21:19.220
Jiang Yi, hurry!

21:19.291 --> 21:20.621
- Let's go! - Hurry!

21:22.490 --> 21:23.490
- Hurry. - How is it?

21:24.091 --> 21:24.761
Instructor.

21:24.831 --> 21:25.761
- Go to the vacant lot. Be careful. - Hurry.

21:25.831 --> 21:27.460
- Be careful. - Hurry, go to the side.

21:28.101 --> 21:29.400
The building collapsed.

21:29.470 --> 21:31.700
Go inside!

21:32.031 --> 21:32.841
Go inside!

21:32.900 --> 21:33.841
Are you all right?

21:33.900 --> 21:35.200
What's going on?

21:35.271 --> 21:35.970
Go over there.

21:36.410 --> 21:37.440
Is everyone all right?

21:37.611 --> 21:38.271
Are you all right?

21:38.341 --> 21:39.140
- We're fine, Instructor. - We're good.

21:39.480 --> 21:40.311
That was close.

21:40.841 --> 21:41.740
Luckily, we ran fast.

21:44.581 --> 21:45.410
Xiao Meng...

21:45.581 --> 21:46.551
was so scared.

21:47.220 --> 21:48.081
Xiao Meng, don't be scared.

21:48.150 --> 21:49.150
Have some jerky to calm your nerves.

21:49.250 --> 21:49.920
Here.

21:49.990 --> 21:50.650
Pi Pi.

21:51.051 --> 21:52.521
Where's Chief? Wasn't he with you just now?

21:53.190 --> 21:54.190
Yes, where's Chief?

21:56.531 --> 21:57.230
No, Yang Chi.

21:57.561 --> 21:59.061
I... Chief was with me just now.

21:59.131 --> 22:00.331
After that, I...

22:00.400 --> 22:01.531
Don't be anxious. Think carefully.

22:01.601 --> 22:03.601
What? Tell us. What?

22:03.670 --> 22:04.771
Say it. Where's Chief?

22:04.831 --> 22:05.500
Where is he?

22:05.571 --> 22:07.200
I really don't know where Chief is.

22:07.341 --> 22:08.470
Cut the crap! Go in and look for him!

22:08.541 --> 22:09.470
- Yes. Let's go! - Okay. Come on!

22:09.541 --> 22:10.571
- Chief. - This way.

22:10.640 --> 22:11.341
Xiao Meng.

22:14.180 --> 22:14.881
Chief!

22:14.940 --> 22:15.611
(Xiangfu Nursing Home)

22:15.680 --> 22:17.281
- Chief. - Chief.

22:19.250 --> 22:19.920
Chief.

22:35.061 --> 22:36.500
You can put your feet up higher.

22:36.801 --> 22:38.170
Don't walk on the ground.

22:47.740 --> 22:48.541
Dr. Xu.

22:49.041 --> 22:49.851
Are you all right?

22:50.150 --> 22:51.281
Hurry, come here.

22:51.551 --> 22:52.311
Get the chair.

22:52.381 --> 22:53.220
Get some rest.

22:55.750 --> 22:56.720
Are you too tired?

22:56.791 --> 22:57.791
I'll get you some water.

23:00.160 --> 23:01.460
You haven't rested for a while, right?

23:02.521 --> 23:03.831
Do you have low blood sugar?

23:06.061 --> 23:07.101
You must be too tired lately.

23:07.160 --> 23:07.930
You don't sleep much.

23:08.000 --> 23:09.301
Eat something and get some rest.

23:09.631 --> 23:10.371
Drink some water.

23:10.430 --> 23:12.000
I'm okay. I'll be fine after sitting for a while.

23:12.170 --> 23:12.970
Get back to work.

23:13.041 --> 23:13.700
Okay.

23:13.771 --> 23:14.640
Get some rest then.

23:15.200 --> 23:16.210
Come on, let's get to work first.

23:22.511 --> 23:23.851
Two more boxes of iodine gauze have arrived.

23:23.910 --> 23:25.111
Come and get what you need.

23:25.881 --> 23:27.150
Get me two cans of iodine cotton balls.

23:27.220 --> 23:28.720
- Okay. - And two rolls of gauze.

23:29.021 --> 23:29.750
It's so scary.

23:29.920 --> 23:31.690
- What's wrong? - I just heard from the triage.

23:31.750 --> 23:33.390
The nursing home on the west side had a second collapse.

23:33.761 --> 23:35.321
A firefighter was even pinned under it.

23:36.930 --> 23:38.291
Was the firefighter rescued?

23:38.361 --> 23:39.261
How is he now?

23:39.331 --> 23:40.601
I think they haven't rescued him yet.

23:40.900 --> 23:42.000
They don't know if he's hurt either.

23:44.301 --> 23:44.970
Are you done recording?

23:45.500 --> 23:46.301
Let's go.

23:52.611 --> 23:53.281
Dr. Xu.

23:53.811 --> 23:54.511
Dr. Xu.

23:55.680 --> 23:57.381
A firefighter was pinned under the nursing home.

23:57.450 --> 23:58.680
The Contact Center asked me to find a doctor...

23:58.750 --> 23:59.680
to go to the scene.

23:59.980 --> 24:00.720
Let's go.

24:01.281 --> 24:02.281
Dr. Xu, can you manage?

24:02.351 --> 24:03.490
Do you want to rest more?

24:03.551 --> 24:04.220
I'm fine.

24:06.521 --> 24:07.591
I'll go with you then.

24:07.990 --> 24:09.291
You two stay here and take care of the injured.

24:09.361 --> 24:10.460
- Okay. - Okay.

24:13.331 --> 24:15.761
- Chief. - Chief.

24:16.430 --> 24:17.271
Song Yan.

24:17.700 --> 24:20.000
- Chief. - Chief.

24:20.700 --> 24:23.011
- Chief. - Chief.

24:24.210 --> 24:25.041
Chief.

24:25.440 --> 24:26.240
Jiang Yi.

24:26.980 --> 24:27.781
Anything on your end?

24:27.980 --> 24:28.781
Nothing here either.

24:28.841 --> 24:29.511
I've looked everywhere.

24:29.581 --> 24:30.250
Song Yan!

24:30.311 --> 24:31.011
Where's Da Peng?

24:31.081 --> 24:31.811
He's not here either.

24:31.881 --> 24:32.920
I didn't find him.

24:36.720 --> 24:37.390
Over here!

24:38.150 --> 24:39.291
Everyone, stop.

24:39.960 --> 24:40.821
Let's think.

24:42.021 --> 24:43.031
Who was the last person...

24:44.061 --> 24:45.660
who saw Song Yan earlier?

24:48.061 --> 24:48.900
Who was it? Speak.

24:48.960 --> 24:49.670
Earlier,

24:50.101 --> 24:51.601
it was Ge Zheng who was with the chief.

24:52.170 --> 24:52.871
I think it was me.

24:53.841 --> 24:54.700
You think?

24:54.771 --> 24:55.771
Think carefully!

24:55.841 --> 24:56.841
No, during the aftershock,

24:56.910 --> 24:58.041
I was carrying an old man.

24:58.940 --> 24:59.740
Someone pushed me from behind.

24:59.811 --> 25:00.910
I thought it was you.

25:00.980 --> 25:02.311
I was holding Xiao Meng.

25:02.381 --> 25:03.210
What about Pi Pi?

25:03.281 --> 25:04.250
It wasn't me either.

25:04.381 --> 25:06.351
I was carrying someone in front of you.

25:07.381 --> 25:08.051
Ge Zheng.

25:08.281 --> 25:08.950
Don't panic.

25:09.490 --> 25:10.190
Think carefully.

25:11.051 --> 25:12.190
That could be the chief.

25:18.390 --> 25:19.131
Xiao Meng.

25:20.160 --> 25:21.900
- Bring the life detector here. - Bring it! Hurry up!

25:21.960 --> 25:23.400
Check Xiao Meng's location.

25:26.031 --> 25:27.640
We can get through here and there too.

25:27.871 --> 25:29.200
Around the corner on the first floor.

25:29.511 --> 25:30.871
It should be around here.

25:31.311 --> 25:31.970
Pi Pi.

25:34.081 --> 25:34.740
Come on.

25:35.240 --> 25:36.111
Come on.

25:36.511 --> 25:37.180
Instructor.

25:40.680 --> 25:41.920
Wait, I'll lower the radar.

25:45.950 --> 25:46.660
Wait.

26:10.781 --> 26:11.551
Will it work?

26:11.680 --> 26:12.450
Wait.

26:12.851 --> 26:13.551
Wait.

26:13.621 --> 26:14.781
There's some signal.

26:15.150 --> 26:15.821
Slow down.

26:17.190 --> 26:18.420
First floor's corner.

26:20.960 --> 26:22.121
Don't come this way.

26:22.561 --> 26:23.861
It's easy to mess up the signal.

26:26.061 --> 26:27.531
- I got it. It's here. - Where?

26:27.601 --> 26:29.031
- There's a signal. - Here!

26:29.101 --> 26:30.601
- Don't move. - Slow down.

26:31.101 --> 26:31.831
Wait.

26:32.400 --> 26:33.771
The structure is very complicated down there.

26:34.601 --> 26:35.601
Don't gather around.

26:36.140 --> 26:37.640
Lift and put things down carefully.

26:38.041 --> 26:38.811
If you're not careful,

26:39.240 --> 26:40.811
you could cause a secondary collapse.

26:41.311 --> 26:42.011
Do you hear me?

26:42.081 --> 26:42.740
- Okay. - Okay.

26:43.311 --> 26:44.180
Come on.

26:44.881 --> 26:46.351
Come on. Clear the sides first, then clear the middle.

26:47.621 --> 26:48.381
One by one.

26:51.150 --> 26:51.821
Come on.

27:03.430 --> 27:04.200
Take that side.

27:08.740 --> 27:09.400
Here, Jun Ping.

27:10.140 --> 27:10.811
Take it.

27:12.041 --> 27:12.740
Come on.

27:13.511 --> 27:14.180
Come on.

27:14.240 --> 27:16.881
- One, two... - One, two...

27:25.390 --> 27:26.051
Wait.

27:26.121 --> 27:27.220
- There's an opening. - Wait.

27:27.291 --> 27:28.621
Instructor, there's an opening.

27:30.361 --> 27:31.061
Song Yan!

27:31.631 --> 27:32.331
Song Yan!

27:32.730 --> 27:34.430
Chief!

27:34.500 --> 27:35.261
- Song Yan! - Chief!

27:35.900 --> 27:36.700
Song Yan!

27:37.101 --> 27:38.571
Instructor.

27:38.771 --> 27:39.430
Over there!

27:43.511 --> 27:44.170
- Chief! - Chief!

27:44.240 --> 27:44.940
- Song Yan! - Song Yan!

27:45.710 --> 27:47.240
- Instructor! - Da Peng, get the instructor!

27:47.341 --> 27:48.140
Grab him!

27:48.311 --> 27:49.081
Song Yan!

27:51.581 --> 27:52.250
Watch out!

27:52.680 --> 27:53.351
Chief!

27:53.420 --> 27:54.220
- Instructor! - Chief!

27:54.281 --> 27:55.581
- Where is he? - Over there!

27:55.750 --> 27:56.450
Chief!

27:56.750 --> 27:57.490
Chief!

27:59.321 --> 28:00.291
- Yang Chi. - Present.

28:00.361 --> 28:01.160
Take one team...

28:01.420 --> 28:02.561
and go around from below.

28:02.861 --> 28:03.660
Open a new path.

28:03.730 --> 28:04.460
See if it works.

28:04.591 --> 28:06.061
Okay. Da Peng, Pi Pi.

28:07.631 --> 28:08.361
Chief.

28:08.430 --> 28:09.700
- Go. - Hang in there.

28:18.511 --> 28:19.170
We can't knock it down.

28:19.240 --> 28:20.081
The wall is too brittle.

28:22.440 --> 28:23.450
Any casualties here?

28:24.351 --> 28:25.011
Excuse me.

28:27.621 --> 28:28.420
Any casualties?

28:33.121 --> 28:33.821
Where's Song Yan?

28:39.960 --> 28:40.831
Where's Song Yan?

28:51.041 --> 28:51.771
He's here.

28:56.480 --> 28:57.150
Song Yan.

29:00.781 --> 29:01.680
Song Yan!

29:04.390 --> 29:05.351
Song Yan.

29:12.730 --> 29:13.700
Let me go down.

29:14.131 --> 29:14.801
I can't.

29:15.561 --> 29:16.301
It's very complicated...

29:16.801 --> 29:17.601
down there.

29:18.170 --> 29:19.271
It's very unsafe.

29:19.571 --> 29:20.601
He needs me.

29:20.670 --> 29:21.940
Let me go down.

29:22.000 --> 29:23.440
I can't risk your life.

29:23.511 --> 29:24.640
He's my life!

29:24.710 --> 29:26.071
Let me go down.

29:31.980 --> 29:33.450
Instructor, we've checked.

29:33.521 --> 29:34.480
It's safe to go down.

29:34.950 --> 29:36.890
Let Dr. Xu examine Chief's condition first.

29:37.150 --> 29:38.750
Then we'll decide on a solution.

29:39.960 --> 29:40.621
Rope.

29:40.960 --> 29:41.660
Rope.

29:41.720 --> 29:43.831
- Rope. Hurry! - Rope!

30:01.240 --> 30:02.011
Slowly.

30:02.081 --> 30:02.781
Be careful.

30:04.111 --> 30:04.881
Slowly.

30:05.950 --> 30:06.621
Those at the back, hold it well.

30:06.680 --> 30:07.351
Loosen the rope.

30:07.420 --> 30:08.381
Those at the back, hold it well.

30:10.750 --> 30:11.420
Come on.

30:11.890 --> 30:12.551
Loosen it.

30:12.750 --> 30:13.420
Loosen it.

30:17.561 --> 30:18.230
Loosen it.

30:18.291 --> 30:18.960
Loosen it.

30:19.361 --> 30:20.031
Loosen it.

30:20.660 --> 30:21.331
Loosen it.

30:38.381 --> 30:39.111
Song Yan.

30:50.631 --> 30:51.361
Dr. Xu.

30:52.430 --> 30:53.531
How is Song Yan?

30:55.230 --> 30:57.271
The rebar pierced his abdomen.

30:58.500 --> 30:59.331
Chief.

31:00.301 --> 31:01.071
Chief!

31:01.440 --> 31:02.900
- Chief. - Chief.

31:03.140 --> 31:05.111
- Chief. - Chief.

31:05.311 --> 31:06.240
- Don't cry. - Chief!

31:06.311 --> 31:07.041
Don't cry.

31:07.111 --> 31:07.781
Stop crying.

31:07.881 --> 31:09.240
Chief isn't dead. Why are you crying?

31:14.121 --> 31:15.521
His pulse is very weak now.

31:16.081 --> 31:17.220
He needs an IV.

31:18.021 --> 31:18.950
First aid kit!

31:22.660 --> 31:23.460
Here.

31:26.131 --> 31:26.831
Slowly.

31:26.900 --> 31:27.561
Dr. Xu.

31:48.521 --> 31:49.680
Hang in there.

31:50.920 --> 31:51.621
Song Yan.

31:52.551 --> 31:53.761
Hang in there.

32:43.710 --> 32:44.940
Song Yan.

32:48.480 --> 32:50.881
Don't leave me alone.

32:52.910 --> 32:54.881
Don't leave me.

33:28.781 --> 33:29.450
Instructor.

33:29.521 --> 33:30.190
How about this?

33:30.390 --> 33:31.091
I'll go down with Jiang Yi...

33:31.150 --> 33:31.821
to cut the rebar.

33:31.950 --> 33:32.890
Let Dr. Xu come up first.

33:32.950 --> 33:34.121
Yes, we'll go down.

33:34.561 --> 33:35.220
Okay.

33:35.561 --> 33:36.390
Get the tripod.

33:36.460 --> 33:37.131
Hurry!

33:37.960 --> 33:38.690
Hurry, get the tripod.

33:38.761 --> 33:39.460
Okay.

33:39.861 --> 33:40.561
Come on.

33:41.700 --> 33:42.400
Dr. Xu.

33:44.200 --> 33:45.400
Why don't we pull you up first?

33:46.071 --> 33:47.301
There's not enough space down there.

33:48.670 --> 33:50.541
They will go down first...

33:50.871 --> 33:52.041
to cut the rebar.

33:52.541 --> 33:53.381
Okay?

34:01.321 --> 34:02.980
Doctor!

34:03.390 --> 34:04.051
Hurry.

34:04.121 --> 34:05.091
There's someone injured here. Hurry.

34:05.321 --> 34:06.220
Slowly.

34:06.291 --> 34:07.291
- Don't shake her. - Don't shake her. Slow down.

34:07.361 --> 34:09.021
- Don't shake her. Gently. - There's an injured person.

34:09.361 --> 34:10.261
Put her in a little.

34:10.361 --> 34:11.591
Gentler. Gently.

34:11.890 --> 34:12.561
- Thank you for your hard work. - Thank you.

34:12.631 --> 34:13.631
- Leave her to us. - We'll leave her to you.

34:13.700 --> 34:14.361
- Okay. - Relax.

34:14.430 --> 34:15.200
- Hurry, let's continue. - Let's go.

34:15.301 --> 34:15.960
Come on.

34:16.100 --> 34:17.031
Move it a little this way.

34:17.230 --> 34:18.531
Where does it hurt? Tell me.

34:18.600 --> 34:19.270
My stomach hurts.

34:19.330 --> 34:20.301
Your stomach hurts?

34:21.201 --> 34:21.870
Does it hurt here?

34:24.071 --> 34:24.870
Does this hurt?

34:29.310 --> 34:30.750
It's a ruptured spleen. She needs surgery.

34:31.150 --> 34:32.511
- Relax. - Doctor, it hurts.

34:32.881 --> 34:33.721
We'll help you right away.

34:34.150 --> 34:35.221
Dr. Xu.

34:38.750 --> 34:39.551
Yes.

34:40.391 --> 34:41.460
There's a critical patient here...

34:41.520 --> 34:42.560
who needs surgery now.

34:42.620 --> 34:44.031
Please save me, Doctor.

34:44.091 --> 34:45.560
We'll save you. Relax.

34:48.600 --> 34:49.900
Okay, I'm coming.

36:25.460 --> 36:26.290
Give me the first aid kit.

36:27.730 --> 36:28.400
Hold her.

37:24.350 --> 37:25.020
Li Nan.

37:25.290 --> 37:26.250
Inform Xu Xi immediately...

37:26.321 --> 37:28.060
to send another ambulance here on standby.

37:28.120 --> 37:28.790
Okay.

37:36.161 --> 37:38.330
Yes, bring two nurses and an ambulance here now.

37:43.040 --> 37:43.841
Watch your step!

38:16.540 --> 38:19.210
I remember where I had seen that female doctor before.

38:24.411 --> 38:25.080
Battalion Commander.

38:25.381 --> 38:26.781
A firefighter over there is pinned down.

38:27.480 --> 38:28.150
Fall in!

38:28.350 --> 38:29.020
Fall in!

38:29.080 --> 38:30.080
- Hurry! - Get ready to save him.

38:30.150 --> 38:31.620
- Hurry up. - Let's go.

38:35.620 --> 38:36.420
I'll hold him.

38:41.161 --> 38:41.830
Hold on tight.

38:44.701 --> 38:45.431
Chief.

38:46.370 --> 38:47.341
It's just the three of us now.

38:47.801 --> 38:48.600
No outsiders.

38:49.040 --> 38:50.411
Let me tell you a secret.

38:51.011 --> 38:53.011
Yang Chi has been eyeing your position for a long time.

38:53.471 --> 38:54.381
You can't let anything happen to you.

38:54.641 --> 38:56.011
Don't let him get it so easily.

38:56.440 --> 38:57.111
Chief.

38:57.381 --> 38:58.580
Don't listen to Jiang Yi.

38:59.580 --> 39:00.881
Even if they really give me the position,

39:01.420 --> 39:02.721
I can't control these jerks.

39:02.781 --> 39:03.520
It must be you.

39:03.591 --> 39:04.721
You have to control us.

39:06.551 --> 39:07.290
Come on.

39:07.891 --> 39:08.591
One more.

39:10.431 --> 39:11.091
Chief.

39:11.861 --> 39:13.491
Our team members are watching you up there.

39:13.730 --> 39:15.000
You have to get back on your feet.

39:15.460 --> 39:16.330
Yang Chi said...

39:16.531 --> 39:17.770
my mouth is jinxed.

39:18.031 --> 39:19.230
You'll surely be very lucky.

39:19.301 --> 39:20.540
My mouth is blessed.

39:20.600 --> 39:21.600
You'll surely be fine.

39:21.841 --> 39:23.241
Yes, it's definitely blessed.

39:23.370 --> 39:24.170
Nothing will happen to you.

39:24.540 --> 39:25.940
He can hear everything.

39:26.071 --> 39:26.741
Look.

39:27.011 --> 39:28.141
He's looking at us having fun.

39:28.341 --> 39:29.881
Last time, he borrowed five yuan from me...

39:29.940 --> 39:31.011
to buy drinks, so he didn't want to pay me back.

39:36.821 --> 39:37.491
Come on.

39:37.650 --> 39:38.420
Slow down.

39:38.551 --> 39:39.650
I'll be slow, of course.

39:45.591 --> 39:46.391
Okay.

39:46.460 --> 39:47.460
This is the angle.

39:53.770 --> 39:54.641
There's a rebar on him.

39:54.701 --> 39:55.600
We can't use a stretcher.

39:56.100 --> 39:56.801
Rope.

39:57.141 --> 39:58.011
Safety rope. Hurry.

40:01.980 --> 40:02.741
Hook it up.

40:05.650 --> 40:06.381
Raise the winch.

40:06.451 --> 40:07.181
Raise it slowly.

40:11.120 --> 40:11.891
Raise it.

40:12.051 --> 40:13.091
- Raise it slowly. - Come on.

40:13.150 --> 40:13.821
Up.

40:18.361 --> 40:19.091
Slowly.

40:29.170 --> 40:30.000
Slow down.

40:51.931 --> 40:52.661
Slowly.

41:06.940 --> 41:07.641
Chief!

41:16.051 --> 41:17.091
Be gentle.

41:17.250 --> 41:18.850
Gentler. Don't touch his wound.

41:37.471 --> 41:38.141
Song Yan.

41:38.210 --> 41:38.870
Sir.

41:38.940 --> 41:39.741
You'll be fine at the hospital.

41:40.170 --> 41:41.841
- You'll be fine at the hospital. - Hang in there.

41:42.681 --> 41:43.781
Don't touch his wound.

41:44.781 --> 41:46.011
Watch out for his wound.

41:49.920 --> 41:52.620
- Chief. - Chief.

41:53.451 --> 41:54.161
Hang in there.

41:54.761 --> 41:55.520
Chief!

41:57.261 --> 41:58.161
Hang in there.

41:58.491 --> 41:59.290
Chief.

42:01.460 --> 42:02.330
Chief.

42:03.900 --> 42:04.600
Chief.

42:06.031 --> 42:07.301
Be careful.

42:07.841 --> 42:08.940
Song Yan.

42:11.611 --> 42:12.770
- Chief. - Song Yan.

42:13.841 --> 42:14.681
Song Yan.

42:15.741 --> 42:17.011
- Slowly. - Save him!

42:17.350 --> 42:18.011
Slowly.

42:18.250 --> 42:19.011
Slowly.

42:19.080 --> 42:20.181
- Lift him up. - Lift him up.

42:20.250 --> 42:20.920
Gently.

42:20.980 --> 42:21.750
- Be careful. - Put him down gently.

42:21.821 --> 42:22.721
Slowly.

42:23.051 --> 42:24.051
Don't hurt him.

42:27.861 --> 42:29.261
- Go. - Close the door.

42:29.321 --> 42:30.460
Close the door. Go down.

42:30.531 --> 42:32.730
Close the door! Hurry up!

42:32.790 --> 42:33.591
Get in the car.

42:33.661 --> 42:34.861
Get in. Close the door.

42:52.611 --> 42:53.281
Battalion Commander.

42:53.381 --> 42:54.681
Do you know that firefighter?

42:56.051 --> 42:57.821
He was once my best comrade.

43:02.221 --> 43:02.891
Form up!

43:03.891 --> 43:04.591
Continue the search!

43:05.060 --> 43:05.891
Let's go!

43:33.321 --> 43:34.321
- Xiao Meng. - Xiao Meng.

43:34.661 --> 43:35.361
Xiao Meng.

43:35.821 --> 43:36.620
Don't go after him.

43:38.730 --> 43:40.600
Xiao Meng went looking for his chief.
